Z||000000||Tweek||06-07-2001||12:42 PM||||I spent about 1.5 hrs. getting just the tach from an '84 Fiero, and the left rear taillight from an mid 80s caravan...   They charged me $10 for the tach, and $25 for the light...  I guess Im just used to places that will practically give me stuff if its small enough to fit in like a microwave or simlilar...   Least now i dont feel bad about taking all their door handle tabs for Oreif...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
